/** بعد حفظ takribi في DB: إنشاء جلسة PF وإظهار الهاش أسفل اللوحة فوراً (بدون انتظار أول دور) */
async function bootstrapPfForTakribiMessage(msgID, channelID) {
  if (!(mongoose.connection && mongoose.connection.readyState === 1)) return;
  try {
    const ch = client.channels.cache.get(String(channelID));
    if (!ch) return;
    const msg = await ch.messages.fetch(String(msgID)).catch(() => null);
    if (!msg || !msg.embeds?.length) return;
    const tk = await takribi.findOne({ msgID: String(msgID) }).lean();
    if (!tk?.user1 || !tk?.user2) return;
    const existing = await provablyFairSystem.model.findOne({ messageId: String(msgID) }).select('_id').lean();
    if (!existing) {
      await provablyFairSystem.createTakribiProvablyFairSession(client, {
        messageId: String(msgID),
        channelId: String(channelID),
        guildId: String(msg.guild?.id || ''),
        user1: String(tk.user1),
        user2: String(tk.user2),
        no3: String(tk.gameType || 'takribi_pvp'),
        modeLabelAr: 'تحدي بين لاعبين',
      });
    }
    await provablyFairSystem.patchMessageEditWithPfHash(msg);
    const raw = msg.embeds[0];
    const embed = raw && typeof raw.addFields === 'function' ? raw : new MessageEmbed(raw || {});
    await provablyFairSystem.applyPfHashToTakribiEmbed(embed, msg.id);
    await msg.edit({ embeds: [embed], components: msg.components }).catch(() => {});
    pfSessionBootstrapCache.add(String(msgID));
  } catch (_) {}
}

async function ensurePfSessionForChallengeMessage(messageObj, embedTitle = '') {
  if (!messageObj?.id || !(mongoose.connection && mongoose.connection.readyState === 1)) return;
  const messageId = String(messageObj.id);
  if (pfSessionBootstrapCache.has(messageId)) return;

  const hasChallengeTitle = String(embedTitle || '').includes('بيانات التحدي');
  if (!hasChallengeTitle) return;

  try {
    const existing = await provablyFairSystem.model.findOne({ messageId }).select('_id').lean();
    if (existing) {
      pfSessionBootstrapCache.add(messageId);
      await provablyFairSystem.patchMessageEditWithPfHash(messageObj);
      if (messageObj.embeds?.length) {
        const raw = messageObj.embeds[0];
        const embed = raw && typeof raw.addFields === 'function' ? raw : new MessageEmbed(raw || {});
        await provablyFairSystem.applyPfHashToTakribiEmbed(embed, messageObj.id);
        await messageObj.edit({ embeds: [embed], components: messageObj.components }).catch(() => {});
      }
      return;
    }
  } catch (_) {}

  try {
    const challengeDoc = await takribi.findOne({ msgID: messageId }).lean();
    if (!challengeDoc?.user1 || !challengeDoc?.user2) return;

    await provablyFairSystem.createTakribiProvablyFairSession(client, {
      messageId,
      channelId: String(messageObj.channel?.id || ''),
      guildId: String(messageObj.guild?.id || ''),
      user1: String(challengeDoc.user1),
      user2: String(challengeDoc.user2),
      no3: String(challengeDoc.gameType || 'takribi_pvp'),
      modeLabelAr: 'تحدي بين لاعبين',
    });
    await provablyFairSystem.patchMessageEditWithPfHash(messageObj);
    if (messageObj.embeds?.length) {
      const raw = messageObj.embeds[0];
      const embed = raw && typeof raw.addFields === 'function' ? raw : new MessageEmbed(raw || {});
      await provablyFairSystem.applyPfHashToTakribiEmbed(embed, messageObj.id);
      await messageObj.edit({ embeds: [embed], components: messageObj.components }).catch(() => {});
    }
    pfSessionBootstrapCache.add(messageId);
  } catch (_) {}
}

